cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Python Workflow for Polarization and Strain Mapping"
abstract: >
  A reproducible Python workflow for automated extraction of polarization
  vector maps from relative sublattice displacements and directional,
  atom-resolved lattice strain maps derived from local interplanar spacings,
  applied to atomic-resolution STEM images of functional oxides.
authors:
